&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;//Thoughts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I feel there is always going to be something to do, working on something entirely new, something that never existed, something that requires a new kind of architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
